ce=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">10.50<br/>July 7, 2014<br/>Summer Update 2014</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\nThe <b>Rathleton New Sewers</b> are located under <a href=\"#/wiki/Oramond\">Oramond</a>'s <a href=\"#/wiki/Workshop%20Quarter\">Workshop Quarter</a>, which is the newer part of the city. Inside it, you'll find teleports that work as shortcuts from one area to another, but you can also walk around it. The entrance can be found south of the Workshop Quarter, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33621,31981,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33621, 31981, 7)</a>. Despite being just next to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Rathleton%20Ancient%20Sewers\">Ancient Sewers</a>, they are not directly connected. \n</p><p>The sewers are not frequently used as a hunting area since the number of creatures and the map design to not favor a good experience ratio or profit. Thus, it's mostly visited by those looking to complete missions for the <a href=\"#/quest/oramond-quest\">Oramond Quest</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Main Area</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Devourer\"><img alt=